/text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">正常关系回归</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">温度减正常关系预期</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">单电流阈值</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">电流高于固定阈值</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"3\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">残差持续超限？回看原始信号</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">持续偏离复核</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">连续超限再回看信号</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">异常时间片段</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">异常时片与首次告警</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">召回与误报事件</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">分钟召回和误报事件</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><figure><h3>按设备组织正常记录</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正常设备三信号到训练 / 完整序列\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#284b55\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><rect x=\"215\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0d9\"/><rect x=\"425\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><path d=\"M178 50H210M388 50H420\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5c8f8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"17\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">正常设备三信号</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">按设备切分</text><text x=\"437\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">训练 / 完整序列</text></g></svg><figcaption>设备来源不跨训练与测试。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>拟合正常温度关系</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正常负荷与电流到温度预期\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#284b55\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><rect x=\"215\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0d9\"/><rect x=\"425\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><path d=\"M178 50H210M388 50H420\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5c8f8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"17\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">正常负荷与电流</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">正常关系回归</text><text x=\"437\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">温度预期</text></g></svg><figcaption>每个时刻的观测温度与预期温度。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>从残差形成告警</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"温度观测 − 预期到复核告警\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#284b55\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><rect x=\"215\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0d9\"/><rect x=\"425\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><path d=\"M178 50H210M388 50H420\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5c8f8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"17\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">温度观测 − 预期</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">阈值 + 持续性</text><text x=\"437\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">复核告警</text></g></svg><figcaption>告警序列与首次持续告警时间。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>核查事件与基线</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"冻结两种告警到PR / 误报事件\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#284b55\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><rect x=\"215\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0d9\"/><rect x=\"425\" y=\"18\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee7\"/><path d=\"M178 50H210M388 50H420\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5c8f8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"17\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">冻结两种告警</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">评价时段对照</text><text x=\"437\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\">PR / 误报事件</text></g></svg><figcaption>分钟级指标与事件计数分别显示。</figcaption></figure>"
      },
